WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:00.860
With a camera.

00:01.643 --> 00:04.695
A camera can keep its shutter open and let the light pile up.

00:05.223 --> 00:06.474
Now the colour is there.

00:06.794 --> 00:07.874
It was always there.

00:08.172 --> 00:10.069
The red is hydrogen gas.

00:10.506 --> 00:19.166
Its light here comes from a photograph taken through colour filters with an extra one for glowing hydrogen, so the red is stronger than an eye would find it.
